    # ai:ConvolutionalNeuralNetwork, ai:RecurrentNeuralNetwork,
    # ai:SupervisedLearning / UnsupervisedLearning / SelfSupervisedLearning /
    # ReinforcementLearning / TransferLearning, ai:RuleBasedTechnique,
    # ai:SymbolicReasoning, ai:BayesianNetwork, ai:SupportVectorMachine,
    # ai:DecisionTree, ai:LLM (subClassOf ai:Model, added DPV 2025-12-17).
    # DPV has no explicit "Transformer" architecture concept yet - do not
    # invent one; leave as a gap until DPV adds it.
    # Candidate secondary anchors: Tool4Boxology model subclasses
    # (t4b:NeuralNetwork, t4b:Transformer, ...) via skos:exactMatch - do not
    # copy them as BEAM classes (Rule R5 / Task 4 decision).
